{"id":"ccf84662da3832c0","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-FS-consistency.md","title":"FS 的有限片段模型及句法一致性","display":"thm-FS-consistency — FS 的有限片段模型及句法一致性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-FS-consistency","aliases":["91-thm-FS-consistency"],"display":"thm-FS-consistency — FS 的有限片段模型及句法一致性","depends_on":["[[91-df-FS-n]]","[[91-df-revision-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-FS-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-FS-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-FS-consistency — FS 的有限片段模型及句法一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd9d450264433858\" href=\"?note=fd9d450264433858\" title=\"91-df-FS-n\">91-df-FS-n</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d3a4c127d0fc0fb\" href=\"?note=7d3a4c127d0fc0fb\" title=\"91-df-revision-theory\">91-df-revision-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 为经典一阶满足关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}_n\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fd9d450264433858\" href=\"?note=fd9d450264433858\" title=\"91-df-FS-n\">91-df-FS-n</a> 的有限规则片段，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}=\\bigcup_n\\mathrm{FS}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}=\\bigcup_n\\mathrm{FS}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7d3a4c127d0fc0fb\" href=\"?note=7d3a4c127d0fc0fb\" title=\"91-df-revision-theory\">91-df-revision-theory</a> 的经典修正。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 表示没有固定矛盾句的有限证明；全部断言在容许标准满足关系的元理论中表述。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto\\Gamma^n(A))\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\mathrm{FS}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto\\Gamma^n(A))\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\mathrm{FS}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS}_n),\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS}_n),\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一行是 Theorem 14.15 的模型构造方向。选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\varnothing\">\\(A=\\varnothing\\)</span> 即为每个片段给出模型。任一 FS 的有限证明只使用有限次 NEC 和 CONEC，属于某个片段；若它证明矛盾，其片段模型将违反经典逻辑可靠性。因此 FS 一致。\n这些片段模型的算术 reduct 都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>，同一论证还表明 FS 的全部算术后果在标准模型为真（Corollary 14.18）。片段的真理外延依 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 改变，没有据此构造一个标准 FS 模型；FS 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致性仍成立。\n旧断言以未证明的归约性质作前提，实际没有陈述原书的一致性结果。现提供书中的具体有限模型证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 14.15、Corollaries 14.16–14.18，印刷页 156–160，PDF 页 167–171。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-FS-n","status":"resolved","id":"fd9d450264433858","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS-n]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-revision-theory","status":"resolved","id":"7d3a4c127d0fc0fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-revision-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-FS-n","status":"resolved","id":"fd9d450264433858","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FS}_n$ 是 [[91-df-FS-n]] 的有限规则片段，$\\mathrm{FS}=\\bigcup_n\\mathrm{FS}_n$；$\\Gamma$ 是 [[91-df-revision-theory]] 的经典修正。","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-revision-theory","status":"resolved","id":"7d3a4c127d0fc0fb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FS}_n$ 是 [[91-df-FS-n]] 的有限规则片段，$\\mathrm{FS}=\\bigcup_n\\mathrm{FS}_n$；$\\Gamma$ 是 [[91-df-revision-theory]] 的经典修正。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}=\\bigcup_n\\mathrm{FS}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto\\Gamma^n(A))\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\mathrm{FS}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS}_n),\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS}).","display":true},{"tex":"A=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1902,"backlinks":[{"id":"6490c20309820655","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-FS-consistency]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["fd9d450264433858","7d3a4c127d0fc0fb"]}